  "body": "<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * This change is making the spec align more closely with what is already implemented. Chromium and Gecko have already implemented most of the changes here, and have minor bugs to iron out.\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/18591\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/30267\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/30539\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1248381\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1730147\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=143842 , https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=233430\n- [x] Spec dependencies:\n   * https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/6537\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n___\n\nThis PR replaces #4857 and builds onto @zcorpan's work. This addresses content proposed to be better suited for CSS UI. See [comment no. 1](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4857#issuecomment-688942700), [comment no. 2](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/3526#issuecomment-689146382) and [relevant PR](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/6537).\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7004/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2021, 10:00 PM UTC (e675645)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7004/32a94ad...e675645/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2021, 10:00 PM UTC (e675645)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7004/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2021, 10:00 PM UTC (e675645)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7004/32a94ad...e675645/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2021, 10:00 PM UTC (e675645)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7004/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2021, 10:00 PM UTC (e675645)\">/rendering.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/7004/32a94ad...e675645/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2021, 10:00 PM UTC (e675645)\">diff</a> )\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n\n### :boom: Error: Wattsi server error :boom: ###\n\n[PR Preview](https://github.com/tobie/pr-preview#pr-preview) failed to build. _(Last tried on Mar 31, 2022, 9:35 AM UTC)_.\n\n<details>\n<summary>More</summary>\n\n\nPR Preview relies on a number of web services to run. There seems to be an issue with the following one:\n\n:rotating_light: [Wattsi Server](https://github.com/domenic/wattsi-server) - Wattsi Server is the web service used to build the WHATWG HTML spec.\n\n:link: [Related URL](https://build.whatwg.org/wattsi)\n\n```\n<html>\r\n<head><title>524 Origin Time-out</title></head>\r\n<body bgcolor=\"white\">\r\n<center><h1>524 Origin Time-out</h1></center>\r\n<hr><center>cloudflare-nginx</center>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n\n```\n\n_If you don't have enough information above to solve the error by yourself (or to understand to which web service the error is related to, if any), please [file an issue](https://github.com/tobie/pr-preview/issues/new?title=Error%20not%20surfaced%20properly&body=See%20whatwg/html%237004.)._\n</details>\n",
